1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:04,119
मीरा के दिन थकान से शुरू होते थे।
Meera's days began with tiredness.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:10,652
कम नींद, तीसरी कॉफ़ी, और मुरझाया मन।
Too little sleep, a third coffee, a wilted mood.

3
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:16,920
फिर उसने VaiLyf पर रोज़ का छोटा-सा लॉग शुरू किया।
Then she started a small daily log on VaiLyf.

4
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:22,450
आठ गिलास पानी। घर का खाना।
Eight glasses of water. Home-cooked food.

5
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:27,242
6,000 क़दम। सात घंटे की नींद।
6,000 steps. Seven hours of sleep.

6
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:32,830
जिस दिन मन नहीं किया, उस दिन टीम साथ थी।
On the days she didn't feel like it, her team was there.

7
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:38,176
चार हफ़्ते। छोटी आदतें, बड़ा फ़र्क़।
Four weeks. Small habits, a big difference.

8
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:42,361
अब मीरा पूछती है, आज क्या नया करूँ?
Now Meera asks: what new thing shall I try today?

9
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:47,640
VaiLyf Wellness: आपकी टीम की सेहत का साथी।
VaiLyf Wellness: your team's partner in health.
